Burr is a female, red-scaled [[Bestiary/Visitors from Beyond#Kobold|Kobold]] of about 10 years. She's originally from [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/Junction/index|Junction]], but [[People/Althane/Anatoli Suvchek|Anatoli Suvchek]] identified her engineering talents and saved her from a life in the mines.

Burr was mind-controlled by a [[Phenomena/Althane/Bioarcanic Engineering|bioarcanically engineered]] creature living in her stuffed animal, and assassinated [[People/Althane/Yantho|Yantho]]. She has no recollection of the events.
